## Current State (Pack C SHIPPED)

**Shipped this round (Pack C — auth, per `docs/features/auth/PRD-TRD-auth.md` B1–B6):**
- **Route guards** — `authGuard` (auth required → /login with `?returnUrl`) + `roleGuard('VETTER','OPERATOR')` (per-community governance per CONTEXT.md); every protected route carries `canActivate: [authGuard]` in `app.routes.ts`.
- **E2E session helper** — `frontend/e2e/helpers/auth.ts` (`seedSession`); 10 specs seed a live token; register routes to /login (signup issues no token).
- **2FA challenge surface** — /login flips creds → 6-digit code step; `submitCode()` → `auth.login2fa()` → /dashboard; errors stay on step; back link returns to creds.
- **KYC + 2FA status** — profile identity card derives `kycLabel()`/`kycBadgeVariant()`/`twofaLabel()` from `auth.member()` (was hardcoded "Verified"/"TOTP").
- **Sign out** — profile `signOut()` calls `auth.logout()` (server flush + local clear) + navigates to `/`.
- **401→refresh retry** — authInterceptor single-flight refresh (shared in-flight promise), retries once with rotated Bearer, clears session + propagates on failure; /auth/login + /auth/refresh never carry Bearer.

**Commits (4 code + docs):** `60c9256` guards+e2e seeding → `36e8e74` 2FA surface → `ca033c0` profile KYC/2FA/signOut → `e53aca4` interceptor retry. Each passed the full 11-check pre-commit gate.

**Verification (all green):**
- eslint strict: 0 problems
- vitest: **1048/1048** (was 1001 at Pack B)
- `ng build --configuration production`: exit 0
- Playwright e2e: 157/157

**Note on a hook gotcha:** the TDD check's `TEST-COUPLED` marker regex needs `// TEST-COUPLED:` on the line directly above the declaration — `* TEST-COUPLED:` inside a block comment does NOT count (blocked one commit; learned in `tdd-enforcement/SKILL.md`). A vitest run also flaked 6 unrelated page specs on 5s timeouts once under parallel load — rerun clean passes 1048/1048; not a code issue.

